body:
@kradalby Completely agree that there could be a bigger change involving the removal of the expectation that the username is unique. However I'm not that familiar with the code base and this is a must have feature at the moment for us.

Since 0.24 we are having issues with the user creation and each new user requires manual operations.

This change is working for us and since we have only one allowed domain in the OIDC, we are guaranteed to have unique usernames. Could we make this configurable? If someone is in our situation this is a perfectly valid solution.
